## 4. Shape, spacing, elevation

- Spacing scale (px): 4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64. Side padding is 20px on mobile and 32px on tablet and up.
- Radius: cards 24px, buttons 999px (full pill), inputs 16px, tags 999px, images 28px.
- Shadows stay minimal. Prefer flat color blocks and borders. Cards use `0 1px 2px rgba(26,26,26,0.06)`.
- Graphic motif: large soft circles and pill shapes in coral, sun, or cobalt, cropped off the edge of hero sections or placed behind photos. Use one per screen at most, and none on medication, results, or billing screens.
- Each screen has one primary action, generous white space, and one dominant headline.

